{"version":1,"content":"<html><body>\n<p>\n煙韌拉絲!4款口味:大推薄荷朱古力\n</p>\n<h2>森林麵包推出韓國大熱脆皮朱古力千層麻糬</h2>\n<p>森林麵包由11月2日起新推出韓國大熱脆皮生朱古力千層麻糬，$38件，提供4款口味：香橙朱古力、薄荷朱古力、士多啤梨朱古力、抹茶朱古力。鮮奶麻糬皮用糯米粉同木薯粉製成，煙韌又拉絲；內餡是生朱古力 ganache，面層再灑可可粉，做到外脆煙韌的質感。官方建議當脆皮雪條咁食，買完約 15 分鐘內食最爽脆！</p>\n<p>森林麵包 @theforestbakerylokwah<br/>\n售價$38／件，11 月 2 日：香橙朱古力、薄荷朱古力、士多啤梨朱古力、抹茶朱古力；11 月 9 日推出新口味鳳仙（外皮香蕉朱古力；入餡芒果醬＋白朱古力＋忌廉 ganache）</p>\n<p>首輪分店：觀塘 The Angle、太古城、圓方，每日限量，售完即止；每人限購兩件</p>\n<p>【知道香港人超級忙，忙到無時間諗食乜玩乜買乜，「新假期吃喝玩樂」 幫你每日精選玩樂、食買靈感，一網打盡全港食買玩熱點！想分享你嘅最愛地點？DM 我哋，一齊帶出港人生活新態度！】</p>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/17935992235716332_8466896646ae826f7b5cac.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"478\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/17935992235716332_8466896646ae826f7b5cac.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>(圖片來源：官方圖片)</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179359922469963441_7494204336ae826f8d62db.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"478\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179359922469963441_7494204336ae826f8d62db.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>(圖片來源：官方圖片)</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179359922615455305_17246618056ae826fa5d38c.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"478\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179359922615455305_17246618056ae826fa5d38c.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>(圖片來源：官方圖片)</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179359922767483830_4772829586ae826fbc4359.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"478\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179359922767483830_4772829586ae826fbc4359.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>(圖片來源：官方圖片)</figcaption></figure>\n<blockquote><p>在 Instagram 查看這則貼文<a href=\"https://www.instagram.com/p/DfOZgF8k9n2/?utm_source=ig_embed&amp;utm_campaign=loading\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">新假期 Weekend Weekly（@weekendweekly）分享的貼文</a></p></blockquote>\n<p>\n</p>\n</body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-02T07:00:52.831662+00:00","quality":{"score":2,"chars":544,"images":4,"source":"WeekendHK","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-02T06:00:29+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-02T08:18:28.702555+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-02T06:58:36.432337+00:00","content_hash":"4f1f45753e537eb1ce19c1a7eace031f1c2fd99f420b0099ff362dc6232b07cd","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}